{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Watcher's Eye is a horror-like game based on the legends of the Dark Web. Your main goal is to survive by spotting as many anomalies as possible on the CCTV cameras. If you have a keen eye for observation then this game is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056950/extras/806aca36629679196fc474436799fe28.avif?t=1760533227\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056950/extras_big/806aca36629679196fc474436799fe28.webp?t=1760533227 width=1560 height=737 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CCTV\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to spot all the anomalies for 6 cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056950/extras/76509648f9a0e015c896e61ec7587b87.poster.avif?t=1760533227\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056950/extras/76509648f9a0e015c896e61ec7587b87.webm?t=1760533227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056950/extras/76509648f9a0e015c896e61ec7587b87.mp4?t=1760533227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beat the game.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056950/5e2fab09b64ee62dec497a5db392e6d3529aaee9.jpg"},{"name":"Find the secret ending.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit